<title>NEW ZEALAND: Telecom buys 1.96 mln shrs off-market.</title>
<headline>Telecom buys 1.96 mln shrs off-market.</headline>
<dateline>WELLINGTON 1996-05-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Telecom Corp of New Zealand said it had bought back 1,963,678 shares off market on Tuesday at NZ$6.64 each, as part of its share buyback programme.</p>
<p>This represented 0.1058 percent of the total number of issued shares in Telecom at the beginning of Tuesday's session.</p>
<p>In a statement the company said the total number of issued shares in Telecom following the latest purchase was 1,826,841,393, excluding 25.5 million shares held as treasury stock.</p>
<p>-- Wellington newsroom 64 4 4734 746</p>
